    description: "On thc (2,717 test files, nearly all ExUnit .exs under test/), the sketch's Tests section reads \"2717 test files · vitest\" -- ExUnit is not named; vitest comes from extension/package.json. Test files are counted correctly; the framework label is wrong/incomplete. Detect ExUnit (test/test_helper.exs with ExUnit.start, `use ExUnit.Case`) and list every detected test framework."  # 5975
